               <code code="34069-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HOW SUPPLIED SECTION"/>
               <title>HOW SUPPLIED</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Fluorometholone ophthalmic suspension, USP, 0.1% is supplied sterile in opaque white LDPE bottles with high density pink caps as follows:</paragraph>
                  <list listType="ordered">
                     <item>      5 mL in 10 mL bottle NDC 0781-6187-75</item>
                     <item>      10 mL in 10 mL bottle NDC 0781-6187-70</item>
                  </list>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Storage:</content>Store at 2° to 25°C (36° to77°F); Protect from freezing. Store in an upright position.

 </paragraph>
